        <IRI>#publisher</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">Publisher</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#publisher</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">A company or publishing entity responsible for the financing, production, and commercial distribution of publications.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#publisher</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Empresa ou entidade editorial responsável pelo financiamento, produção e distribuição comercial de publicações.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">este registro bibliográfico é categorizado como possuindo uma qualidade de completude do registro do tipo &quot;Completo&quot; porque ele contém todas as tags obrigatórias do MARC 21 (tais como 020, 100, 245 e 300) exigidas para incorporação ao nível de Biblioteca Nacional.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">this bibliographic record is categorized as having a complete record completeness quality because it contains all mandatory MARC 21 tags (such as 020, 100, 245, and 300) required for National Library level ingestion.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">Chosen under bfo:quality -&gt; information_carrier because the completeness of a MARC 21 record is an intrinsic attribute that measures the metadata enrichment of a data structure, rather than a macroscopic physical property of general matter.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Escolhida sob bfo:quality -&gt; information_carrier porque a completude de um registro MARC 21 é um atributo intrínseco que mede o nível de preenchimento de uma estrutura de dados e strings textuais codificadas, e não uma propriedade física macroscópica da matéria geral.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">An intrinsic quality inhering in a bibliographic record that indicates its level of data enrichment and structural detail according to MARC 21 standard rules.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Uma qualidade intrínseca que inere em um registro bibliográfico que indica o seu nível de enriquecimento de dados e detalhamento estrutural de acordo com as regras do padrão MARC 21.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Completude do Registro</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel"/>
        <IRI>#record_completeness</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">Record Completeness</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">Allows query search systems to know which core abstract creation a specific record points to, bypassing the expression/manifestation layer for analytical retrieval.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">MARC 21 record 123 represents_work the abstract work of Dom Casmurro.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Permite que os sistemas de busca saibam para qual criação abstrata central um registro específico aponta, ignorando as camadas de expressão/manifestação para fins de recuperação analítica.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">o registro MARC 21 123 representa_obra a obra abstrata de Dom Casmurro.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">A shortcut or direct relation linking a metadata string (Bibliographic Record) to the abstract creation (Work) it is intellectually associated with.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Um atalho ou relação direta vinculando uma cadeia de metadados (Registro Bibliográfico) à criação abstrata (Obra) com a qual está intelectualmente associada.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="pt-br">Representa Obra</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel"/>
        <IRI>#represents_work</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en-us">Represents Work</Literal>
